<title>AUSTRIA: Wienerberger sells offices to Immofinanz.</title>
<headline>Wienerberger sells offices to Immofinanz.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian top brick maker Wienerberger said on Thursday it had sold its Business Park Vienna office and retail complex to Immofinanz for more than three billion schillings in cash and liabilities .</p>
<p>The group also said it had acquired a 150 million schilling stake in Immofinanz, which it said was one of Austria's leading real estate units.</p>
</text>
